  "description": "File-based fallback provider for OutWit.Shared.Secrets — for deployments with no reachable OS credential store (containers, session-less services). Never selected automatically: configuration names it. One file per key with owner-only permissions verified at creation, atomic replace via temp-file-and-rename, DPAPI machine-scope protection on Windows (Protection=FileWithPlatformKey) and honest FileOnly elsewhere. Read the package README for what this does not defend against.",
